.autoeda/runtime/versions.md:1232:- motivation: `stmap23` rejected the less critical moderate seed at node `24798`, but still admitted node `37979` with slack `7.170013` and final `syn2` QoR stayed at the worse `stmap22` value of `491.54 ps`. `stmap24` tests whether moderate deep seeds should be admitted only when slack is at most `1.1 * tDelayInv.Worst`, leaving strong deep seeds controlled by the `stmap21` arrival-gain rule.
